1
00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:01,480
(Leonard:)Gentlemen.

2
00:00:01,945 --> 00:00:04,975
- Where have you been?
- Nurse's office.

3
00:00:06,049 --> 00:00:08,519
- Asthma attack?
- Asthma, heart. Some kind of attack.

4
00:00:08,718 --> 00:00:10,278
(Leonard:)I'm fine, though.

5
00:00:11,521 --> 00:00:13,781
(Howard:)You guys going to
Professor Tupperman's memorial?

6
00:00:13,990 --> 00:00:15,720
- Probably not.
- Barely knew him.

7
00:00:15,959 --> 00:00:19,829
Yeah, you wouldn't wanna look like you guys
are brownnosing the tenure committee...

8
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:21,690
(Howard:)...who will all be there.

9
00:00:23,033 --> 00:00:27,063
(Leonard:)- Oh, yeah.
- Meerkats.

10
00:00:32,642 --> 00:00:37,812
(Sheldon:)I won't be able to make our date night
this Thursday, so bad news for you.

11
00:00:39,349 --> 00:00:41,249
(Amy:)You better have a good excuse this time.

12
00:00:41,484 --> 00:00:44,644
(Amy:)Because trimming Q-tips to fit your ears
right is obvious nonsense.

13
00:00:46,556 --> 00:00:50,496
(Sheldon:)First of all, when you say things like that,
people think you're crazy.

14
00:00:50,660 --> 00:00:52,460
Second, the reason I'm canceling...

